findings.comment:
750.800e - The following non-food surfaces were soiled:
A) grease cleaning equipment (heavy grease/food debris on general surfaces);
B) dry storage shelves (grease/splash - especially fry pod storage);
C) ICEE syrup storage cabinet below machine (syrup splash);
D) fryers (grease/crumbs) - 1. general surfaces inside panel doors, 2. underneath surfaces, and 3. wheels;  and
E) drain hoses beneath lobby soda machine (mold).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris and maintain them clean.
